<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Eurotherm started as &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Eurotherm started as &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurotherm Plc was rated &quot;buy&quot; as Salomon Brothers began coverage of the stock, a research note from analysts at the brokerage said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The note said concerns over Eurotherm's acquisiton plans should be outweighed by the fact that the group has the resources in terms of financial strength and management ability to expand its operations.</p>
<p>It said acquisitions should expand its growth rate and, given the scale of its cash resources, enhance earnings.</p>
<p>The stock was unchanged at 566-1/2.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
